            0.165,
            0.234,
            0.884,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the jump sizes of 1 or 2 will land on both 14 and 36. Notice that 1 and 2 are the common factors of 14 and 36."
